# Current COR17 contract. Populate fresh COR04 keys for each mutation;
# operationKey = current Unix seconds + "." + a 32-character UUID without hyphens.
# operationRecovery = base64 of 32 random bytes. Reuse both only for response-loss recovery.
@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@accessToken = replace-with-live-access-token
@operationKey = replace-with-fresh-operation-key
@operationRecovery = replace-with-fresh-recovery-key
@idempotencyKey = replace-with-fresh-idempotency-key
@sensitiveActionToken = replace-with-approved-purpose-5-token
@mailboxToken = replace-with-token-from-new-mailbox

### Fresh owner approval; factor-configured accounts must complete eligible authenticator proof
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/reauthenticate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Security-Operation-Key: {{operationKey}}
Security-Operation-Recovery-Key: {{operationRecovery}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"password":"replace-with-owner-password","purpose":5,"target":"email:new@example.test"}

### Request identity change with NEW operation keys and the returned fresh approval
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/adjust
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Sensitive-Action-Token: {{sensitiveActionToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
Security-Operation-Key: {{operationKey}}
Security-Operation-Recovery-Key: {{operationRecovery}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"emailAddress":"new@example.test"}

### Read-only confirmation landing; repeated GETs never complete the change
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/adjust/email/verify?payload={{mailboxToken}}

### Deliberate confirmation with NEW operation keys; the browser form supplies these itself
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/adjust/email/verify
Security-Operation-Key: {{operationKey}}
Security-Operation-Recovery-Key: {{operationRecovery}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

verifyToken={{mailboxToken}}

### Resolve a lost confirmation response using THAT confirmation's keys
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/security-operations/status
Security-Operation-Key: {{operationKey}}
Security-Operation-Recovery-Key: {{operationRecovery}}
